I suppose you could download the source of shiny, httpuv, and Rcpp (and any other packages that Shiny depends on that require a version of R greater than the one you are running) and modify their DESCRIPTION files to lower the version requirement. Then install them one at time, beginning with the one that doesn't have any dependencies on the others.

