The contents of the text area is sent to R as a character string. So your question has nothing to do with shinyAce: you are asking how to convert a table given as a character string to a matrix. In my example, I convert this character string to a dataframe with the read.table() function. Then you can convert this dataframe with the as.matrix() function if you want.

