You need a wrapper function

wrap_ui <- function(x){
  cat(as.character(x))
}

```{r results = 'asis', comment = NA}
wrap_ui(

  textInput("a", "a")

)
```

will give you

<label for="a">a</label>
<input id="a" type="text" value=""/>

